  "ingredients": [
    "vegetable oil for frying",
    "4 cups all-purpose flour",
    "6 tablespoons garlic salt",
    "3 tablespoons ground black pepper",
    "4 large eggs, beaten",
    "8 skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cut into small chunks"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Heat 1 inch oil in a large skillet or saucepan to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aU39fvg8wK0e1y2A_GNJdtLSQYw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161469-the-best-ever-chicken-nuggets-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-5115d793508d410eb5b6abc7be339933.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161469/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir together flour, garlic salt, and pepper in a bowl. Dip chicken pieces into beaten eggs, then press each piece into flour mixture to coat well; shake off excess flour. Place coated chicken pieces onto a plate.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OV9ozoA5LPLQBaYlCAHdFt_RNKw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161469-the-best-ever-chicken-nuggets-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-3d4b0f9893d04737b6ade9769507c829.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161469/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches, fry chicken in hot oil until golden brown and no longer pink in the center.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5B_GJtXa5lt11A_mP-EL3yHJmDk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-161469-the-best-ever-chicken-nuggets-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-6558d4926d4f49d8a0a09f389a420c0b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/161469/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C). Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
